Procedure `genUnaryOp(op, x)` generates code for `op x` if `op` is `MINUS`, `NOT`, `CARD`, `COMPLEMENT`, or `SET`; the `SET` operation is for a singleton set. If `op` is `AND` or `OR`, item `x` is the first operand and an `if` instruction is generated.

